          "date": "2026-11-13 12:41:53.000000000",
          "tz": 600
        },
        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit coverage for lod_pool_add/remove",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit coverage for lod_pool_add/remove\n\nThe lod_pool kunit module covered lod_set_pool(), the pool registry\nlookups and lod_qos_set_pool(), but not lod_pool_add()/lod_pool_remove(),\nthe functions that actually back \"lctl pool_add\"/\"pool_remove\": adding\nor removing an OST from a named pool by UUID, matched against the\ndevice's lod_ost_descs table.\n\nExtend lod_pool_test with a small lod_ost_descs table built via the\nshared mock_tgt helpers (see mock_tgt.h), and add cases covering:\nadding a known target to a pool, rejecting an unknown target name,\nrejecting an unknown pool name, and removing a known target (checked\nvia lod_check_index_in_pool()) while rejecting a target name the\ndevice doesn't know about.\n\nlod_pool_add()/lod_pool_remove() were not previously exported, so\nexport them for use from the kunit module, matching the other\nlod_pool.c entry points.\n\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [augment-code]\nChange-Id: I2e6c6538acabc8c8ca367c7fb437684ed1ca996e\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
